      "body": "Third quarter 2026 results: EPS: ₹0.16 (down from ₹0.19 in 3Q 2025). Revenue: ₹533.8m (down 2.9% from 3Q 2025). Net income: ₹10.0m (down 18% from 3Q 2025). Profit margin: 1.9% (down from 2.2% in 3Q 2025). The decrease in margin was driven by lower revenue. Over the last 3 years on average, earnings per share has increased by 29% per year but the company’s share price has only increased by 10% per year, which means it is significantly lagging earnings growth.",
